  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis PR adds the catalog case `examples/catalog/multiaxis/five-axis`.\nOne original faceted cylinder (radius 12 mm, X = -24 to 24 mm) carries three operations on the Tilt-head 5-axis machine:\n\n- Swarf wall\n- Contour surface (5-Axis Contour)\n- Flow surface (5-Axis Flow)\n\nThe case folder obeys `examples/catalog/README.md`.\nIt has `model/` with its generator script, `build.camscript`, `case.toml`, `five-axis.camproj`, `five-axis.nc` and `README.md`.\nThe script requires a clean `cam.verify()` before it saves and posts.\n`cargo xtask catalog` also lists the case on the three operation sections of `site/content/guide/multi-axis/operations-multiaxis.md`.\n\nThis PR changes no application code and no check.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe case was held on #3300 at e8dd91ed3.\nThe post refused the first tilted feed because the opening moves did not state the rotary pose.\nPR #3421 fixed #3300 on main.\nThis branch merges upstream main and now posts with no change to the held script.\n\n## Readings\n\n- The Swarf passes run along the cylinder rulings (parallel to X). The tool axis lies along the ruling (`B90.` / `B-90.`).\n- This is the documented law of the Swarf kernel (`crates/motion/src/multiaxis/swarf.rs` lines 1-9). It is not a defect.\n- Each operation section states `A` and `B` in a rapid move before the first tilted feed.\n- The case runs in about 11 s in debug. The budget is 60 s. It stays in the quick lane.\n\n## Tests\n\nPins in `crates/app/tests/example_catalog/case_multiaxis_five_axis.rs`:\n\n- `catalog_multiaxis_five_axis::posts_three_clean_five_axis_operations`\n- `catalog_multiaxis_five_axis::regenerates`\n- `catalog_multiaxis_five_axis::rebuilds`\n\nPin proof: on the held head before this work, all three pins failed with `missing five-axis.nc`.\nMutation: I changed `B90.` to `B89.` on line 14 of `five-axis.nc`. `regenerates` and `rebuilds` failed. I restored the file and all three passed.\n\nCommands on the final head e850da857:\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog catalog_multiaxis_five_axis`: 3 passed.\n- `cargo xtask catalog --check`: all 15 cases checked.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 10 steps, 0 failed (includes `app suites: example_catalog`).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nHeavy lanes: not run. The diff touches no motion, sim, post, geometry or operation code. It adds catalog data and one test file.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- `examples/catalog/multiaxis/five-axis/five-axis.nc`: new program for this case.\n- `examples/catalog/multiaxis/five-axis/five-axis.camproj`: rebuilt by `cargo xtask catalog --case multiaxis/five-axis`.\n\nNo other `*.nc` or `*.cl` file changed (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"`).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Posed stock-removal simulation of the case.\n- A run on a physical machine.\n- UI screenshots. This PR changes no UI.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. PRs #4371 and #4316 change files of `multiaxis/indexed`, not this case.\n\nDecision record: `docs/decisions/2870-five-axis.md`.\n\nChangelog: Catalog: new five-axis example case with Swarf, 5-Axis Contour and 5-Axis Flow.\n\nFixes #2870\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
